\begin{editorial}
Basic syntax and semantics for SOL covered so far. As a chapter it's
too short. Substitution for second-order variables has to be covered
to be able to talk about !!{derivation} systems for SOL, and there's some
subtle issues there.
\end{editorial}

\begin{enumerate}
\item A !!{denumerable}s set of second-order relation !!{variable}s of
  every arity~$n$: $\Obj V_0^n$, $\Obj V_1^n$, $\Obj V_2^n$, \dots
\item A !!{denumerable}s set of second-order function !!{variable}s:
  $\Obj u_0^n$, $\Obj u_1^n$, $\Obj u_2^n$, \dots
\end{enumerate}

