\begin{thm}
If $\tuple{M_1, w_1} \leftrightarroweq \tuple{M_2, w_2}$, then for
every !!{formula}~$!A$, we have that $\mSat{M_1}{!A}[w_1]$ iff
$\mSat{M_2}{!A}[w_2]$.
\end{thm}

