\begin{proof}
Let $f$ and $g$ be isomorphisms $A \to B$. We will prove the result by induction, i.e.\ using \olref[wo]{propwoinduction}. 
Fix $a\in A$, and suppose (for induction) that $(\forall b < a)f(b) = g(b)$. Fix $x \in B$.

