\begin{proof}
$\alpha = \supstrict_{x \in A}\setrank{x}$ લો.
\olref{rankmemberslower} મુજબ $\alpha \leq \setrank{A}$.
પરંતુ $x \in A$ હોય, તો $\setrank{x} \in \alpha$;
