\end{thm}

source_text:
\begin{proof}
For any cardinal $\cardfont{a}$, Cantor's Theorem
(\olref[sfr][siz][car]{thm:cantor}) and
\olref[cardinals][cardsasords]{lem:CardinalsExist} entail that
$\cardfont{a} < \card{\Pow{\cardfont{a}}}$.
\end{proof}

target_text:
\begin{proof}
કોઈ પણ ગણાંક $\cardfont{a}$ માટે કૅન્ટરનું પ્રમેય
(\olref[sfr][siz][car]{thm:cantor}) અને
\olref[cardinals][cardsasords]{lem:CardinalsExist}
મુજબ $\cardfont{a} < \card{\Pow{\cardfont{a}}}$.
\end{proof}

