\AxiomC{}
\RightLabel{$\pi_2$}
\Deduce$!B \land !C, \Gamma \fCenter \Delta$
\RightLabel{\CutCS}
\BinaryInf$\Gamma \fCenter \Delta$
\DisplayProof
\]
ધરાવતી !!a{proof}~$\pi$ હોય અને
