\begin{enumerate}
\item A !!{denumerable}s set of second-order relation !!{variable}s of
  every arity~$n$: $\Obj V_0^n$, $\Obj V_1^n$, $\Obj V_2^n$, \dots
\item A !!{denumerable}s set of second-order function !!{variable}s:
